## Why This Is Asked

Tests basic performance diagnosis, tooling, and practical containment without touching tenant apps.

## Key Concepts

- Linux CPU contention and CPU steal
- cgroups v2 and per-tenant isolation
- systemd.slice and CPU quotas
- baseline benchmarking and rollback

## Code Example

```javascript
// Node.js snippet to read tenant quotas
const fs = require('fs');
['tenant-a.slice/cpu.max','tenant-b.slice/cpu.max'].forEach(p=>{
  try { console.log(p, fs.readFileSync(`/sys/fs/cgroup/${p}`, 'utf8').trim()); } catch{}
});
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you validate tests without impacting production workloads?
- What metrics would you alert on to catch regressions?

